 "reply": "```latex\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\sffamily, >=Stealth, line width=0.6pt]\n  % grid: 1 cm = 0.1 m horizontally\n  \\draw[step=1cm, very thin, gray!50] (0,-2) grid (7,2);\n\n  % axes\n  \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (7.8,0) node[right, font=\\small] {distance / m};\n  \\draw[->] (0,-2) -- (0,3.4);\n  \\node[anchor=south west, font=\\small] at (0,2.3) {displacement};\n  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (0,0) {0};\n\n  % tick marks and labels every 0.1 m\n  \\foreach \\x in {1,2,3,4,5,6,7} {\n    \\draw (\\x,0.08) -- (\\x,-0.08);\n  }\n  \\foreach \\x/\\l in {1/0.1,2/0.2,3/0.3,4/0.4,5/0.5,6/0.6,7/0.7} {\n    \\node[below, font=\\small] at (\\x,0) {\\l};\n  }\n\n  % wave: wavelength 4 cm (0.4 m), crosses zero going down at 2.5 cm (0.25 m)\n  \\draw[thick, domain=0:7, samples=200, smooth] plot (\\x, {-1.5*sin(90*(\\x-2.5))});\n\n  % point A on the curve at 0.25 m\n  \\fill (2.5,0) circle (1.8pt) node[above right, font=\\small] {A};\n\n  % point B on the rising part at 0.5 m\n  \\fill (5,1.06) circle (1.8pt) node[above left, font=\\small] {B};\n\n  % direction of travel arrow above the graph, clear of the axis label\n  \\draw[->, thick] (2.5,2.9) -- (6.5,2.9) node[midway, above, font=\\small] {direction of travel of the wave};\n\n  % caption\n  \\node[font=\\small] at (3.5,-2.4) {Fig. 9.1};\n\\end{tikzpicture}\n```\n",
 "source": "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\sffamily, >=Stealth, line width=0.6pt]\n  % grid: 1 cm = 0.1 m horizontally\n  \\draw[step=1cm, very thin, gray!50] (0,-2) grid (7,2);\n\n  % axes\n  \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (7.8,0) node[right, font=\\small] {distance / m};\n  \\draw[->] (0,-2) -- (0,3.4);\n  \\node[anchor=south west, font=\\small] at (0,2.3) {displacement};\n  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (0,0) {0};\n\n  % tick marks and labels every 0.1 m\n  \\foreach \\x in {1,2,3,4,5,6,7} {\n    \\draw (\\x,0.08) -- (\\x,-0.08);\n  }\n  \\foreach \\x/\\l in {1/0.1,2/0.2,3/0.3,4/0.4,5/0.5,6/0.6,7/0.7} {\n    \\node[below, font=\\small] at (\\x,0) {\\l};\n  }\n\n  % wave: wavelength 4 cm (0.4 m), crosses zero going down at 2.5 cm (0.25 m)\n  \\draw[thick, domain=0:7, samples=200, smooth] plot (\\x, {-1.5*sin(90*(\\x-2.5))});\n\n  % point A on the curve at 0.25 m\n  \\fill (2.5,0) circle (1.8pt) node[above right, font=\\small] {A};\n\n  % point B on the rising part at 0.5 m\n  \\fill (5,1.06) circle (1.8pt) node[above left, font=\\small] {B};\n\n  % direction of travel arrow above the graph, clear of the axis label\n  \\draw[->, thick] (2.5,2.9) -- (6.5,2.9) node[midway, above, font=\\small] {direction of travel of the wave};\n\n  % caption\n  \\node[font=\\small] at (3.5,-2.4) {Fig. 9.1};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
